---

This repository vendors the OASIS PKCS #11 v3.2 C headers (pkcs11.h, pkcs11t.h,
pkcs11f.h) under internal/headers/. Those files remain under their own OASIS
copyright and the OASIS IPR Policy; see internal/headers/NOTICE.md. The MIT
license above does not extend to those OASIS-copyrighted headers.

This binding is an independent, clean-room implementation derived from the OASIS
PKCS #11 v3.2 specification and C headers. It is inspired by the design of
miekg/pkcs11 but contains no code copied from it.
